Value Filldown MODE (route|bridge)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LINK (UP|DOWN|ADM|\*DOWN|Stby)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value PRIMARY_IP (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value TYPE (A|T|H)
Value PVID (\d+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*?)

# One record per interface (campus-wan, vpn-fabric and VSR labs, Comware 7.1): a route-
# mode table, then a bridge-mode table with speed, duplex, link type and PVID. The
# Link column reports an administrative shutdown itself (ADM).
Start
  ^Brief information on interfaces in ${MODE} mode:\s*$$
  ^(Link|Protocol|Speed|Duplex|Type):\s.*$$
  ^Interface\s+Link\s+Protocol\s+Primary IP\s+Description\s*$$ -> Route
  ^Interface\s+Link\s+Speed\s+Duplex\s+Type\s+PVID\s+Description\s*$$ -> Bridge
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display interface brief line"

Route
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${LINK}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${PRIMARY_IP}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Brief information on interfaces in ${MODE} mode:\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized route-mode interface row"

Bridge
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${LINK}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PVID}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Brief information on interfaces in ${MODE} mode:\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized bridge-mode interface row"
